WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.040
&lt;i&gt;I don't wanna go to school&lt;/i&gt;

00:00:07.120 --> 00:00:10.000
&lt;i&gt;I don't wanna take the call&lt;/i&gt;

00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:13.080
&lt;i&gt;I just wanna be a fool&lt;/i&gt;

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:15.320
Watching me, please.

00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:17.560
With confidence, please,
everybody.

00:00:17.640 --> 00:00:18.560
Come on!

00:00:19.640 --> 00:00:21.240
One, two, three, four. One.

00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:29.600
Feel it!

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:37.000
Hi, Adam.

00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:38.280
-Nice summer?
-Shut the fuck up.

00:00:38.920 --> 00:00:41.120
Tromboner, give me
what you've got.

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:43.560
Charlie, no. I like you,
but I'm figuring stuff out.

00:00:43.640 --> 00:00:45.080
Literally what more
do you want from me?

00:00:51.960 --> 00:00:53.320
He told you to stop.

00:01:38.560 --> 00:01:40.560
Do you wanna kiss?

00:01:41.240 --> 00:01:42.320
Would that help?

00:01:43.160 --> 00:01:44.000
Wow.

00:01:44.080 --> 00:01:45.960
-Just a suggestion.
-Wow.

00:01:46.040 --> 00:01:47.240
Well, if you're not
interested…

00:01:47.320 --> 00:01:48.680
Ok, hang on.

00:01:51.520 --> 00:01:52.880
It's a good suggestion.

00:01:55.240 --> 00:01:56.800
Good afternoon

00:01:56.880 --> 00:02:00.160
and welcome to
the grand live final

00:02:00.240 --> 00:02:03.560
of the National Student Quiz
Championship.

00:02:03.640 --> 00:02:05.720
Tao, it's fine. I'm fine.

00:02:05.800 --> 00:02:07.800
Truham students,
Higgs students.

00:02:07.880 --> 00:02:11.640
Welcome to the day I know
you've all been waiting for:

00:02:11.720 --> 00:02:14.400
Truham-Higgs Sports Day.

00:02:39.440 --> 00:02:40.600
I auditioned for
Swing Band today.

00:02:40.680 --> 00:02:42.320
Come on. I'm in the lead.
Can you just let me…?

00:02:42.400 --> 00:02:44.280
Can you let me win one time?

00:02:44.360 --> 00:02:45.880
You've already won
like five or six games.

00:02:45.960 --> 00:02:47.240
Yeah,
and I'm going easy on you.

00:02:47.320 --> 00:02:48.320
No.

00:02:48.880 --> 00:02:50.440
-Yes!
-No!

00:02:51.080 --> 00:02:52.520
How are you so good at this?

00:02:55.240 --> 00:02:56.160
I don't know

00:02:57.280 --> 00:02:58.400
what I am.

00:02:59.520 --> 00:03:01.240
And who the hell am I?

00:03:02.480 --> 00:03:04.560
Like, maybe I don't care
about anything enough.

00:03:04.640 --> 00:03:06.920
You're 17. You don't have to
have it all figured out.

